  <participating-org role="4" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At Forward&#xb7;Inc, we believe in the potential of refugees and the power of entrepreneurship to foster economic independence and social integration. Our goal is to create opportunities for forcibly displaced individuals to launch, grow, and sustain their own businesses, ensuring they have the resources, mentorship, and networks needed to succeed.

By 2027, we aim to be the leading organisation in refugee entrepreneurship across Europe and the MENA-T region, supporting over 6,000 aspiring entrepreneurs annually, as well as helping with the launch of at least 250 new businesses, with the ultimate goal of creating jobs, fostering economic growth, and building stronger communities.

Our entrepreneurship programs are designed to remove barriers to participation by offering free entrepreneurship training, one-on-one coaching, and access to diverse networks of entrepreneurs, mentors, experts, investors and corporate partners. We provide practical tools that help refugees turn their ideas into businesses while also fostering a strong sense of community and collaboration.

We embrace the incredible diversity, talent, and resilience of individuals with forcibly displaced backgrounds and highlight the value they add to their societies. As we continue to expand our reach, we remain committed to ensuring that refugees thrive as entrepreneurs and have the right tools to contribute meaningfully to their new societies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Refugees Forward</narrative>
